hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"58","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik radi Allahu 'anhu se riwayat hai ke Nabi sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qur'an ki ek surat hai jis mein sirf tees aayat hain; usne apne sahib ki taraf se hujjat ki yahan tak ke use jannat mein daakhil kar diya, aur woh (Tabarak) hai."
"59","[AI-translation] Jabir se riwayat hai ke Nabi sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam sote nahi thhe yahan tak ke yeh na padh lein: (Alif Laam Meem Tanzeel) aur (Tabaarakallazi Biyadihil Mulk)."
"60","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira se riwayat hai ke Nabi sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam Jum'ah ke din subah ki namaz mein pehli rak'at mein (Alif Laam Meem Tanzeel) padhte thhe, aur doosri rak'at mein (Hal Ata 'Alal Insaan Heen Min Ad-Dahr Lam Yakun Shay'an Mazkoora)."
